# Wisdom cow sayings (Orion #17), translated from the Russian original.
wisdom-say-1 = Durand is a properly assembled cyborg.
wisdom-say-2 = You see the speck in another department, but miss the log in your own.
wisdom-say-3 = You look tired.
wisdom-say-4 = Peace to the world.
wisdom-say-5 = Rejoice while you are alive.
wisdom-say-6 = Avoid reality by any means necessary.
wisdom-say-7 = Are you a turtle?
wisdom-say-8 = Work isn't a wolf, it won't run off into the woods. Sadly.
wisdom-say-9 = Fear the tall man in the red uniform.
wisdom-say-10 = Money can be made by illegal means.
wisdom-say-11 = You will defeat your enemy.
wisdom-say-12 = In truth, you have no enemies.
wisdom-say-13 = You will have a wedding within a year.
wisdom-say-14 = You will have a wedding within a year, and a divorce within two.
wisdom-say-15 = Of course your life has meaning: finding the meaning of life.
wisdom-say-16 = Stop searching for the truth. Focus on fantasies.
wisdom-say-17 = Soon someone will give you a bouquet of flowers.
wisdom-say-18 = You will get what you deserve.
wisdom-say-19 = You are surrounded by fabulous people.
wisdom-say-20 = You will regret it...
wisdom-say-21 = Your favorite color has faded.
wisdom-say-22 = You have so many friends!
wisdom-say-23 = The changeling is a wolf, and it will come to your dorm.
wisdom-say-24 = The galaxy is split into the fair half and the felinids.
wisdom-say-25 = Many captains avoided many disasters by being too lazy to cause them.
wisdom-say-26 = Ashwalkers are so tough they are born straight into the grave.
wisdom-say-27 = Morals are good, and double morals are twice as good.
wisdom-say-28 = As long as an assistant doesn't give up, you can't rent him out.
wisdom-say-29 = An old toolbox lasts longer if you never buy a new one.
wisdom-say-30 = You will go to prison for donating your time and effort to a bank robbery.
wisdom-say-31 = You will be attacked by a beast with the face of a wolf, the tail of a lion and the ears of a mouse.
wisdom-say-32 = Soon you will be hungry.
wisdom-say-33 = If you buy stolen clothes from addicts, you are dressed to the nines.
wisdom-say-34 = So lazy you even drink at the bar.
wisdom-say-35 = A girl stands on the corner, both the goods and the saleswoman...
wisdom-say-36 = The captain's decisions blew the roof off medbay's psychiatric ward.
wisdom-say-37 = Tonight is a full moon. Feel free to transform.
wisdom-say-38 = Sometimes life is life, and you in it are sometimes.
wisdom-say-39 = Don't fear a stab in the back. It's worse when it's your own back.
wisdom-say-40 = Better to fall once than a hundred times.
wisdom-say-41 = Death is no reason to give up.
wisdom-say-42 = If you can't see, you are blind.
wisdom-say-43 = Chasing sheep is for rams. Chase only the good times.
wisdom-say-44 = They call you by your name, but I call you to the dorms.
wisdom-say-45 = If you want to live, know how to live.
wisdom-say-46 = When a tajaran looks at you, it means it sees you.
wisdom-say-47 = Job done, off to cryo.
wisdom-say-48 = I pull invisible strings and manipulate people as I please. I'm a puppet... puppy... pup... I'm a puppeteer, basically.
wisdom-say-49 = A toolbox is the most effective method of gaining access.
wisdom-say-50 = Reverse exorcism is when the devil asks the chaplain to get out of the vulpkanin.
wisdom-say-51 = You look like a million dollars: all green and heavy.
wisdom-say-52 = You are always busy.
wisdom-say-53 = You'll never be the man your mother was!
wisdom-say-54 = You will be run over by a shuttle.
wisdom-say-55 = Don't lose heart!
wisdom-say-56 = The main thing in a person is the soul. Looks are nice, but the soul comes first.
wisdom-say-57 = Better go home.
wisdom-say-58 = When the head of personnel wants to help the crew, there is nowhere to hide.
wisdom-say-59 = Don't worry. Life is too long.
wisdom-say-60 = Soon you will forget you ever saw me.
wisdom-say-61 = A good day to abandon your friends in trouble.
wisdom-say-62 = Big things warm the hands, small things warm the heart.
wisdom-say-63 = What happened last night will happen again.
wisdom-say-64 = Beware of loud noises!
wisdom-say-65 = But here's the point, friends, believe me: only devils gang up on one.
wisdom-say-66 = You are so bloodthirsty, vile and ugly. I like it.
wisdom-say-67 = Great pyramids!
wisdom-say-68 = Stay away from food vending machines, at least TODAY.
wisdom-say-69 = You will live long enough to see your great-grandchildren.
wisdom-say-70 = After the darkest and longest night comes the brightest dawn.
wisdom-say-71 = Your lucky number was dialed wrong.
wisdom-say-72 = Live in harmony and happiness.
wisdom-say-73 = Few will understand, but those who understand are few.
wisdom-say-74 = Bluespace batteries have one downside and one upside.
wisdom-say-75 = Become a clown and security will eat you.
wisdom-say-76 = Prison for the clown, freedom for the mime. No other way.
wisdom-say-77 = Better to be last among humans than first among vulpkanin.
wisdom-say-78 = The dorms and maints are messed up by the same people who wear red suits.
wisdom-say-79 = All access is the symbol of space power.
wisdom-say-80 = Why did the ERT take so long to reach the station? They were learning the Galactic Common alphabet.
wisdom-say-81 = Pwease don't say "nya". It annoys mew.
wisdom-say-82 = Fear has big eyes and a weak liver.
wisdom-say-83 = Station command has hit rock bottom. And started digging.
wisdom-say-84 = You have found the righteous path. And walked it in the wrong direction.
wisdom-say-85 = Security doesn't disfigure the crew. It helps them open up.
wisdom-say-86 = Look in the mirror.
wisdom-say-87 = Working is unpleasant, of course. Better to do it for money.
wisdom-say-88 = You try to fit in with people, but your tail is a felinid's.
wisdom-say-89 = If you draw your sword, be ready for your opponent to do the same.
wisdom-say-90 = Always stay human. Even if you are not human.
wisdom-say-91 = Compassion is not weakness. It is a good trait.
wisdom-say-92 = Nobody drinks vodka without a snack.
wisdom-say-93 = We live in a simulation. To leave it, press the little cross.
wisdom-say-94 = The best candy bar in the whole universe is the Milky Way.
wisdom-say-95 = If there were an extra term in the equation, you wouldn't exist. Someone surely needs you.
wisdom-say-96 = The cycle repeats again. You are here again. Just like last time.
wisdom-say-97 = The janitor is almost family, like a mother. Also cleans up and yells when you don't.
wisdom-say-98 = For the people, the sun rises wherever those in power say it does.
wisdom-say-99 = You can't jump higher than your head. Or really jump at all.
wisdom-say-100 = Teshari are not food. They are an intermediate stage.
wisdom-say-101 = A girl who raises her hand against you instantly becomes your sparring partner.
wisdom-say-102 = In the beginning was the word. And the word was Secret.
wisdom-say-103 = It's fashionable to be human. All pink, proper and totally original.
wisdom-say-104 = If you ask someone, they might do it. No need to break in and threaten them with a knife.
wisdom-say-105 = Don't drink what the assistant offers you.
wisdom-say-106 = For some, the second word is as dear as the first.
wisdom-say-107 = Don't take food from strangers. It's laced with cyanide.
wisdom-say-108 = Corporations want to spray plasma so you'll buy their air. The market settled both itself and you long ago.
wisdom-say-109 = Getting upset over games is bad. You came to relax. Just play by its rules.
wisdom-say-110 = The most abused thing is the one nobody knows about.
wisdom-say-111 = How do you like that, John Nanotrasen?
wisdom-say-112 = Don't eat yellow snow!
wisdom-say-113 = Don't eat in the cafeteria if the kitchen ignored sanitation.
wisdom-say-114 = Times change. Almost nobody shakes hands anymore. It's so hard to reach out.
wisdom-say-115 = Anyone can be a chaplain. But not every chaplain survives a fireball without a scratch.
wisdom-say-116 = Bartending is more than a job. It's the art of being human.
wisdom-say-117 = Glue is not a clue. A clue is evidence, and glue is glue.
wisdom-say-118 = Heroes never die, but only Poly never dies...
wisdom-say-119 = As they said: we will become observers, and they will simply vanish.
wisdom-say-120 = Don't argue with authority. It might answer you and embarrass itself.
wisdom-say-121 = Looks say a lot about a person, but actions say even more.
wisdom-say-122 = Don't trust people in red. Red hides the blood on their clothes.
wisdom-say-123 = Your sector is a social construct. Remove it and nothing changes.
wisdom-say-124 = Nations are a myth. Where I stand, they are less real than hostile corporations.
wisdom-say-125 = Do you remember what you did on your way to work?
wisdom-say-126 = Monkey blood works for humans.
wisdom-say-127 = You have much to do. For example, fixing what you have already done.
wisdom-say-128 = The supermatter grants any wish on touch, especially wishes to disappear.
wisdom-say-129 = The cake is a lie.
wisdom-say-130 = You can't look at the ceiling.
wisdom-say-131 = You don't always need to be where you want to go.
wisdom-say-132 = Wisdom comes with me, and death comes with age.
wisdom-say-133 = Healing people isn't hard for a doctor. Listening to the complaints of the people he operates on is.
wisdom-say-134 = Give an assistant a spear and he'll die on a grille. Teach him to make one, and he'll die on the grille without your spear.
wisdom-say-135 = If the fire alarm light is any color but green, expect trouble.
wisdom-say-136 = Where are all the bike lanes?
wisdom-say-137 = Nobody is asking you. You are obliged.
wisdom-say-138 = Did I ever tell you what the definition of insanity is?
wisdom-say-139 = Space drugs are made from 3 ingredients. Many drinks use more and work worse.
wisdom-say-140 = Rules exist to reduce chaos. No chaos is boring. With boredom, nobody will be around to follow the rules.
wisdom-say-141 = I forgive you.
wisdom-say-142 = I agree with you.
wisdom-say-143 = You are saying the right things.
wisdom-say-144 = Many have lived long enough to start becoming villains.
wisdom-say-145 = Listen to advice, but keep your own head on your shoulders.
wisdom-say-146 = Trouble awaits you. Don't keep it waiting.
wisdom-say-147 = It doesn't matter how fast they chase you, what matters is how fast you run.
wisdom-say-148 = There are no Necromorphs on this station, you are safe.
wisdom-say-149 = Because of His wrath, Magnus was simply misunderstood by his father...
wisdom-say-150 = Now, I define reality myself.
wisdom-say-151 = Shoot the tires!
wisdom-say-152 = The conflict on Gaia is yet another case of humans proving that killing each other is more fun than killing anyone else.
wisdom-say-153 = Ascents. Not Aztecs. Know who you fear.
wisdom-say-154 = Many don't know what "full status" means, but still agree to it.
wisdom-say-155 = Family is everything, brother.
wisdom-say-156 = The oldest war between man and god: throwing spears into the sea and firing catapults at it.
wisdom-say-157 = A robot can't compose a symphony if you don't give it the instruments.
wisdom-say-158 = No hole is scarier than a hole in a hardsuit.
wisdom-say-159 = As they say, everything passes, but something might get stuck.
wisdom-say-160 = Not everything comes, but everything goes.
wisdom-say-161 = We could all be human, but we live in a society...
wisdom-say-162 = If an officer is running, you'd better run faster.
wisdom-say-163 = Better to have a friend than to have each other.
wisdom-say-164 = A fall is not a failure. A failure is a failure. A fall is where you fell.
wisdom-say-165 = Don't be afraid when you are alone. Be afraid when you are the thing others fear.
wisdom-say-166 = I'm not your underpants, don't adjust me.
wisdom-say-167 = You don't need love. You need a liter of beer.
wisdom-say-168 = Better to be late and keep your dignity than be on time and mess yourself.
wisdom-say-169 = Value a person not for their looks, but for their beautiful body.
wisdom-say-170 = Size isn't everything. Positioning is.
wisdom-say-171 = Remember: if you've been eaten, there are still two ways out...
wisdom-say-172 = A wolf isn't a tiger, but it's still funny.
wisdom-say-173 = Poly is a good conversationalist.
wisdom-say-174 = There has been no love here for a long time. God has left this place.
wisdom-say-175 = Always keep 3 things secret: relationships, income and browser history.
wisdom-say-176 = If a panic attack is inevitable, don't panic: attack first.
wisdom-say-177 = During a vote, people split into two camps: quick elections and endless debates.
wisdom-say-178 = Love comes and goes. Like a tajaran on a night shift.
wisdom-say-179 = Teshari are small, but their opinions are very loud.
wisdom-say-180 = You don't notice a good head of staff, but you'll discuss a bad one long after the shift.
wisdom-say-181 = Greentext is the biggest scam in the history of modern spaceflight.
wisdom-say-182 = Appreciate villains. They let heroes shine.
wisdom-say-183 = There are no bad coworkers. Only inflated expectations.
wisdom-say-184 = Corruption isn't that bad, until you learn it was your tax money.
wisdom-say-185 = Just like anarcho-capitalism. A snake fighting its own tail.
wisdom-say-186 = You like kissing, don't you?
wisdom-say-187 = The initiator doesn't have the initiative, it's the other way around.
wisdom-say-188 = If you don't know what a wool suit is, you'd better not find out.
wisdom-say-189 = Always smirk at the mirror. Someone in there smirks back.
wisdom-say-190 = Permabrig isn't imprisonment. It's an exquisite execution by boredom, with options to leave.
wisdom-say-191 = Don't turn to God for help, He might answer in a way you won't like.
wisdom-say-192 = Rely on your own strength. If you rely on others, you'll also have to control them.
wisdom-say-193 = I will definitely survive.
wisdom-say-194 = Don't trust a vulpkanin with a big chest. As a rule, the chest isn't the only big thing.
wisdom-say-195 = If you fear the vulpkanin, don't go to the dorms.
wisdom-say-196 = Assistants are the biggest mistake on a research station.
wisdom-say-197 = While I tell you all this, you don't notice what's happening around you.
wisdom-say-198 = The HoS is the head with the biggest and most loaded authority.
wisdom-say-199 = Romance is like a butterfly. It can land on your nose, or hit you in the eye.
wisdom-say-200 = If security offers to let you put on the handcuffs voluntarily, they just want to try something new.
wisdom-say-201 = Before shouting about idiot gods, pick a religion first.
wisdom-say-202 = Fantasies are like plasma. They get in the way day to day, but work wouldn't be as fun without them.
wisdom-say-203 = Never look into the abyss if you are afraid of heights: jump without looking.
wisdom-say-204 = GMOs are long gone in this beautiful future. They went further: meat from grass, and people from metal and plastic.
wisdom-say-205 = Everyone used to summon Bloody Mary. Now kids in bathrooms whisper about some Nar'Sie.
wisdom-say-206 = Time flies, and a shotgun is still considered an anti-space defense weapon.
wisdom-say-207 = You can't fly away from space problems: they travel at space speeds.
wisdom-say-208 = Every time you want to talk to your enemies in red, they shoot you. And it's not even the Syndicate!
wisdom-say-209 = The singularity went from a terrifying cosmic phenomenon to just another power source in an instant. Its hunger did not shrink, though.
wisdom-say-210 = Preferences are something you should never turn all the way up.
wisdom-say-211 = If something seems magical, science just hasn't explained it yet.
wisdom-say-212 = All access comes in several forms. One of them is a toolbox.
wisdom-say-213 = Knowing where to put punctuation is what separates some people from others.
wisdom-say-214 = Entertaining games should say at the end that you've beaten them.
wisdom-say-215 = When life gives you lemons, make lemonade.
wisdom-say-216 = Small things aren't so bad. Just ask anyone who has carried a big toolbox all shift.
wisdom-say-217 = Anyone can throw a stone at a cow, but not everyone can throw a cow at a stone.
wisdom-say-218 = If you're blessed with brains, be clever. But to be clever you need brains, so don't be clever without them.
wisdom-say-219 = Don't trust those you don't trust: faith in distrust breeds more distrust than faith.
wisdom-say-220 = Better to fall a hundred times than to fall from grace once.
wisdom-say-221 = If you hurt someone, don't be a coward about it: apologize and make it right.
wisdom-say-222 = Never give up: learn to stand on both your hands and your feet.
wisdom-say-223 = The best way to eat bananas is to blend them first, then wash them down with water.
wisdom-say-224 = Consequences are like the tax office: sooner or later, you'll answer to them.
wisdom-say-225 = In virtual reality there's something more important than life. Fun, for example.
wisdom-say-226 = A ceiling can't have a color anyway.
wisdom-say-227 = Villains don't always lose because they're weak. Sometimes losing is more interesting than winning by the dirtiest tricks.
